  "sourceTitle": "Midori Tequila Sunrise",
  "sourceText": "Midori Tequila Sunrise\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 ounce Tequila\n1 ounce Midori Liqueur\n1 ounce cherry mix\nfill orange juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Pour tequila and Midori in a highball glass with ice; top with orange juice. Stir. Tilt glass and pour grenadine down the side.\n\nAbout\n\n\nGarnish with a stirrer, straw and a cherry or orange slice.",
